---
/** Privacy notice (GDPR art. 13), English. Controller, VAT number and email come from contacts.json. */
import type { Contacts } from '../../lib/content/schemas';

interface Props {
  contacts: Pick<Contacts, 'email' | 'piva'>;
}

const { contacts } = Astro.props;
const mailto = `mailto:${contacts.email}`;
---

<!-- DRAFT: must be reviewed by a qualified professional before relying on it. -->

<p class="updated">Last updated: 11 November 2026</p>

<p>
  This page explains what data I collect when you visit this site or write to me through the contact form, why I
  use it and what rights you have. It is a notice under Article 13 of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR).
</p>

<h2>Who is responsible for your data</h2>
<p>
  The data controller is <strong>Simone Guarneri</strong>, Italian VAT no. (P.IVA) <span data-piva>{contacts.piva}</span>.<br />
  Email: <a href={mailto} data-email>{contacts.email}</a>
</p>

<h2>What I collect through the contact form</h2>
<p>When you write to me through the form, I only collect what you type in:</p>
<ul>
  <li>who you are (owner, partner or investor, other);</li>
  <li>your name;</li>
  <li>your email address;</li>
  <li>your phone or WhatsApp number, if you choose to give it;</li>
  <li>your message.</li>
</ul>
<p>
  The message reaches me by email through <strong>Web3Forms</strong>, a service that forwards forms from static
  websites. Web3Forms handles this data on my behalf, as a data processor, only to deliver the message to me. If the
  form is not available, you can email me directly at the address above.
</p>

<h2>Why I use it and on what legal basis</h2>
<p>
  I use your data only to read your request and reply to you. I don't use it for newsletters or advertising and I
  don't sell it to anyone.
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    If your request is about a possible engagement or collaboration, the legal basis is the pre-contractual steps you
    ask for (GDPR Art. 6(1)(b)).
  </li>
  <li>
    In all other cases, the legal basis is my legitimate interest in replying to people who contact me
    (GDPR Art. 6(1)(f)).
  </li>
</ul>
<p>Giving your data is optional, but without your name, email and message I can't reply.</p>

<h2>How long I keep it</h2>
<p>
  I keep messages for as long as needed to handle your request, and in any case no longer than 24 months after our
  last contact. If we start working together, the data needed for that work is kept for as long as the law requires.
</p>

<h2>Visit statistics</h2>
<p>
  To know how many people visit the site I may use <strong>GoatCounter</strong>, a privacy-friendly analytics
  service. GoatCounter sets no cookies, does not track people across sites and collects no personal data: it only
  counts visits in aggregate (for example the page viewed, the referring site, the browser type). That is why this
  site shows no cookie banner.
</p>

<h2>Theme preference</h2>
<p>
  If you pick the light or dark theme, your browser saves that choice in its local storage
  (<code>localStorage</code>, key <code>sg-theme</code>). It is only a technical preference: it stays on your device,
  is never sent to me and does not identify you. You can clear it at any time in your browser settings.
</p>

<h2>Fonts</h2>
<p>
  The site’s fonts are hosted on the site itself. Your browser makes no requests to third-party font services (such
  as Google Fonts), so your IP address is not shared with them.
</p>

<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>Under Articles 15 to 22 of the GDPR you can ask me at any time to:</p>
<ul>
  <li>tell you whether I hold data about you and give you a copy (access);</li>
  <li>correct or complete it (rectification);</li>
  <li>delete it (erasure);</li>
  <li>limit how I use it (restriction);</li>
  <li>give it to you in a readable format so you can take it elsewhere (portability);</li>
  <li>stop using it where I rely on legitimate interest (objection).</li>
</ul>
<p>
  Just send an email to <a href={mailto}>{contacts.email}</a>. I will reply within one month.
</p>
<p>
  If you think your data is being handled incorrectly, you can lodge a complaint with the Italian data protection
  authority, the <strong>Garante per la protezione dei dati personali</strong>
  (<a href="https://www.garanteprivacy.it" rel="noopener" hreflang="it">garanteprivacy.it</a>).
</p>

<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>
  If anything in this notice changes, I update the date at the top of the page.
</p>
